# The Gitrog, Ravenous Ride: only "a creature that saddled it this turn" can be sacrificed, and it puts "up to X" lands, not X. Savannah Lions (power 2) saddles it; the
# Ornithopter (power 0, so it could not even have saddled it) is refused as the sacrifice. Bot1 sacrifices the Lions and draws two (Forest, Mountain) but puts only the Forest
# onto the battlefield (tapped); the Mountain stays in hand.

